<h1 style="border:0px; height:1px; margin:0px!important;" aria-label="Secretary of the Commonwealth of Massachusetts, William Francis Galvin"></h1>
                        
<!--%%%% QUOTE %%%%%-->

<div class="galvin-quote">

<div class="quote-container">
<p style="font-size:1.2em; color:#8f0909; line-height:1.1em; margin-top:0px!important;">&quot;The history of Massachusetts is the history of America. 
And that is true, and is truer today than ever before.&quot; 
<span class="notranslate">- Secretary William F. Galvin</span>
</p>
